                    		  <p style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 200; line-height: 18px;">Please enter the 3-digit Card Security Code (CSC) which are the last three numbers printed on the signature strip on the back of your card.</p>
                              <div style="padding: 15px 20px 15px; text-align: center;"><div class="csc-background"></div></div>
                              <label class="labelTxt"><span class="csc"></span></label>
                               <input id="cscInput" type="text" name="cscText" aria-invalid="false" aria-required="false" data-testid="csc-input" pattern="[0-9]*" aria-labelledby="cscPassword-label cscPassword-alert-label" class="input-control" maxlength="3" value="">
                             <div style="line-height: 15px;">&nbsp;</div>
